ass=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-title\"><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/38px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/50px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Opportunity Attack\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp/25px-Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Opportunity_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\"><b>Opportunity Attack</b></a></span></p></div><div class=\"bg3wiki-pi-creature-detail-text\"><p>Attack an enemy moving out of reach.</p></div></div></li></ul></div>\n</div></section></section>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section><section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\"><h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Technical</h2><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>S_LOW_Guildhall_FetchersBrat_001</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_Guildhall_FetchersBrat_001+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_LOW_Guildhall_FetchersBrat_001+type:localcharacter%2Cglobalcharacter%2Ccharactertemplate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"uuid\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">UUID</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>721084d3-de1a-4213-93db-c7f93cf9d632</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:721084d3-de1a-4213-93db-c7f93cf9d632\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:721084d3-de1a-4213-93db-c7f93cf9d632\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div><div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"stats\">\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-label\">Stats</div></h3>\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-tech-data\"><code>Human_Child</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Human_Child+type:statscharacter\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Human_Child+type:statscharacter\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div></div>\n</div></section></aside>\n<b>Li'l Fezmor</b> is a member of Fetcher's Brats within <a href=\"/wiki/The_Guild\" title=\"The Guild\">The Guild</a>.\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>Fezmore can be found inside the <a href=\"/wiki/Guildhall\" title=\"Guildhall\">Guildhall</a>. She replaces <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mol\" title=\"Mol\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png/25px-Portrait_Mol.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png/38px-Portrait_Mol.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png/50px-Portrait_Mol.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mol\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png/25px-Portrait_Mol.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/43/Portrait_Mol.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mol\" title=\"Mol\">Mol</a>, if Mol did not survive <a href=\"/wiki/Act_One\" title=\"Act One\">Act One</a>, however she does not act as a trader.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Idle_banter\">Idle banter</span></h2>\n<p>Li'l Fezmor will occassionally chat with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Floridor\" title=\"Floridor\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Floridor.png/25px-Portrait_Floridor.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Floridor.png/38px-Portrait_Floridor.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Floridor.png/50px-Portrait_Floridor.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Floridor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Floridor.png/25px-Portrait_Floridor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Portrait_Floridor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Floridor\" title=\"Floridor\">Floridor</a>:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Floridor</dt><dd>Does it always take this long? Nothing went wrong, did it?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd><i>Please</i>, lady! Strong emotions can mess up the settling of the humours!</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Floridor</dt><dd>I... I guess I don't want the humours messed up, do I?</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Floridor</dt><dd>Hi, it's me again! Just wondering about that recipe.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>We're working on it, all right? It's got, like, three different viscosities in it.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Floridor</dt><dd>Very well, very well. I don't want to upset the process.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Floridor</dt><dd>Is that special recipe ready yet? Just checking.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>'Fraid not, saer. We're still gathering the, you know, special fluid.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Floridor</dt><dd>All right. I'll try to be patient. But he's eager.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Floridor</dt><dd>Really, I must insist on delivery of my order!</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>Now you've done it! The middle slime layers have inverted. I'm going to have to start over.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Floridor</dt><dd>Son of a lich! All right, start over, then.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<p>Li'l Fezmor will also occassionally chat with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Happy_Hands\" title=\"Happy Hands\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Portrait_Happy_Hands.png/25px-Portrait_Happy_Hands.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Portrait_Happy_Hands.png/38px-Portrait_Happy_Hands.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/79/Portrait_Happy_Hands.png/50px-Portrait_Happy_Hands.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Happy Hands\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/79/Portrait_Happy_Hands.png/25px-Portrait_Happy_Hands.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/79/Portrait_Happy_Hands.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Happy_Hands\" title=\"Happy Hands\">Happy Hands</a>:\n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>Happy. Another job - just a little light finger-work this time.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Happy Hands</dt><dd>I did the last one!</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>And lost half the coin on the cobbles. I'm giving you a chance to prove you're not a total dunce.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>Happy. Thought I slipped you a job?</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Happy Hands</dt><dd>Yes, boss. Just, uh... waiting for the right moment.</dd></dl></li>\n<li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>The right moment is when I told you to do it the first time.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>Take much longer, Happy, and they'll have to call you <i>Smashed</i> Hands instead.</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-transcript\">\n<ul><li><dl class=\"bg3wiki-dialogue-line\"><dt>Li'l Fezmor</dt><dd>Where'd Happy get to?</dd></dl></li></ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Li%27l_Fezmor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Li'l Fezmor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Li%27l_Fezmor\">Li'l Fezmor</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul ul{display:inline}.mw-parser-output .hlist dd,.mw-parser-output .hlist dt,.mw-parser-output .hlist li,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-h